{"id":"60807657c822cc57","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-rp-threshold-invariance.md","title":"RP 的任意固定正常数阈值等价","display":"thm-rp-threshold-invariance — RP 的任意固定正常数阈值等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-rp-threshold-invariance","aliases":["73-thm-rp-threshold-invariance"],"display":"thm-rp-threshold-invariance — RP 的任意固定正常数阈值等价","depends_on":["[[73-thm-rp-amplification]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.5 boxed discussion, print p. 509; PDF p. 531; fixed-constant qualification made explicit","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-rp-threshold-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-rp-threshold-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rp-threshold-invariance — RP 的任意固定正常数阈值等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da661bfc44ef4f5a\" href=\"?note=da661bfc44ef4f5a\" title=\"73-thm-rp-amplification\">73-thm-rp-amplification</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.5 boxed discussion, print p. 509; PDF p. 531; fixed-constant qualification made explicit"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\alpha&lt;1\">\\(0&lt;\\alpha&lt;1\\)</span> 为固定实常数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RPoly},\\mathsf{RP}\">\\(\\mathsf{RPoly},\\mathsf{RP}\\)</span> 采用已列依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{RP}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n[(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)=0)\\land(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)\\ge\\alpha)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\mathsf{RP}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n[(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)=0)\\land(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)\\ge\\alpha)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若已有 1/2 阈值，选择常数次重复使 1−2⁻ᵏ≥α；反向选常数 k 使 (1−α)ᵏ≤1/2。α 必须是统一的正下界；不能以随输入趋零的任意接受概率代替。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-rp-amplification","status":"resolved","id":"da661bfc44ef4f5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-rp-amplification]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"0<\\alpha<1","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RPoly},\\mathsf{RP}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{RP}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n[(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)=0)\\land(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_M^a(w)\\ge\\alpha)].","display":true}],"bytes":1306,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-rp-threshold-invariance|RP 的任意固定正常数阈值等价]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["da661bfc44ef4f5a"]}